Package: armatos-colonia
Version: 2779.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: calamares, python3-toml, armatos-shell, cryptsetup, cryptsetup-initramfs, btrfs-progs, squashfs-tools, dosfstools, sudo
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: colonia: the Armatos Linux installer
 Calamares, dressed in Marmor: found a colony on this computer. Erases the
 disk (or uses the space you choose) for an EFI partition, a plain /boot and
 a LUKS2-sealed Btrfs root with @, @home and @snapshots subvolumes, sets up
 Secure Boot-friendly GRUB with the Armatos menu, and logs you straight into
 the desktop after the boot watchword. Run it with:  colonia
